sections.content:
Define your own exception classes for domain-specific errors.

```python
class InsufficientFundsError(Exception):
    pass

def withdraw(balance, amount):
    if amount > balance:
        raise InsufficientFundsError("Not enough money")
    return balance - amount

try:
    withdraw(100, 200)
except InsufficientFundsError as e:
    print(e)
```

exercise.tests:
assert withdraw(100, 30) == 70
assert withdraw(100, 100) == 0

try:
    withdraw(100, -10)
    assert False
except ValueError as e:
    assert str(e) == "Amount must be positive"

try:
    withdraw(100, 150)
    assert False
except ValueError as e:
    assert str(e) == "Insufficient funds"

